{
 "_about": "Public-domain projections that move the Moat card's MEASURED US Census AIES industry revenue to the current year and +5 (owner decisions 2026-10-22). Census gives the measured value; these series only scale it: value(Y) = measured × S(Y)/S(measured year). Tier rule: the most specific source whose 2017–24 growth tracked Census within 2 pts/yr (BLS sector output → CMS health spending → US nominal GDP → measured only). Refresh yearly with backend/scripts/refresh_industry_tam_projections.py (owner-run). US government works, public domain. Source: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics; Centers for Medicare & Medicaid Services (Office of the Actuary); GDP history: U.S. Bureau of Economic Analysis via CMS.",
